  "description": "The Goodship is a bike designed with a race-inspired geometry and Fairdale sensibilities. Our custom manufactured, seamless, Japanese chromoly, Drawnright tubeset allows us to control the butting position, heat-treatment and tube shaping so the Goodship feels like a rocket every time you stand on a climb or sprint to a city limit sign.\n\nDesigned to work perfectly with an ENVE carbon fiber fork, you’ll recognize the Goodship’s unique road feel immediately whenever you ride it. Built with a full SRAM Force 22 groupset, FSA components and Continental tires to give you a parts build that is both lightweight and reliable.\n\nAvailable either as complete bike or frame and fork kit, so you can build the Goodship exactly how you want it.",
